        desc = "UART_RIS is a raw interrupt status register. The contents of this register are not affected by the UART_IMSC register. Total reset value 0x0002 in the Hi3520D, Hi3516A, Hi3518E V20X, Hi3516A V200, Hi3519, Hi3516C V300 and Hi3516A V300 data sheets (bit 1 set, modelled in `ctsris`); 0x0000 in the Hi3511, Hi3515, Hi3516 V100, Hi3516C V100 and Hi3518 V100 data sheets.

